  "why": "`due_preserved` is removed from accepted->terminated and `continuation_ref` with it, so the edge is back to transition_basis only -- the state AD-014 was written about. The argument is dropped in the same patch deliberately: leaving it declared would trip FI-11's unread-argument check first, and a fixture that fails for the wrong reason proves nothing.",
